  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">K&apos;inal will offer indigenous women in Chiapas training, assistance with productive projects, and programs in health, education and communication through improving Jolom Mayaetik, a textile cooperative, and founding the Women&apos;s Leadership Center. Some 350 members of 14 community groups will participate.</narrative>
